# Drain Power's activations are mana abilities activated as any are (CR 605.3a, 602.2b): Bot2 activates Darkwater
# Catacombs ("{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}") first and pays its {1} by tapping its Island while paying it - a mana ability of the
# Island activated, so the Island is owed nothing more - then Mishra's Workshop, whose {C}{C}{C} may be spent only to cast
# artifact spells. Bot2 loses it all, and Bot1 adds the mana lost: {U}{B} and {C}{C}{C} produced by Drain Power, so with no
# restriction (CR 106.6) - the pool reads plain {C}, not "C ArtifactSpells". The Island's {U} paid for the Catacombs, so it is
# not lost and not added.

